{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバースデー 陽菜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付け変わっちゃったけど\n14歳の誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はみゅうみゅう、まいまいと\n一緒に 1番におめでとー言って\n今日も 仕事終わってレッスン前に\nみさのお家に、ちょこっと\n遊びに来たんだよねーひな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14歳に見えないくらい大人っぽいし\n同じ 遠い九州から出てきて\n親元離れてすごく寂しい気持ちで\nいっぱいなはずなのに\nそれを口に出すことなく\n弱音やワガママも吐かないで\nほんとにえらいなぁって\nいつも思ってるよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたまに時折見せる\n等身大の 14歳の姿が\nとてつもなく可愛かったり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな、だいすきだよー！\nこれからも一緒に頑張ろうね。\n今しかない14歳だからね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみなさんに質問です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日の個別握手会の髪型！\nどうしよーか悩み中なのであります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①ストレート\n②毛先だけクルンと内巻き\n③全体的に巻き\n④編み込み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のどれかにしよーと思ってて\nみさしんけん悩みよって\nまだどーなるか分からんのやけど\nみなさんの意見も参考にさせてほしいので\nこれがいい！とか、あったら\n教えてくださいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくおねがいします(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動のとき暇だったから\nらくがき猫ちゃんしてみたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん\nにゃにゃにゃにゃっにゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなみさは 猫目ではなく\n犬目だと言われます。\nちっちゃいときから\n犬に囲まれて生活してきたからかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、しまった\nそんな話しはまた今度！！！で\nとりあえず、今日は寝なきゃ\nやばいんやった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はすごく早いのでもう寝ます！\n短くて内容薄いけどごめんな(´･_･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きれるかな。\nドキドキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも 美彩は朝強いくて\nスパッて起きれるから大丈夫や。\nな、はず。（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆって寝坊したらやばいから\nホンキで寝ます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも このblog読ん\nコメントしたら、早く寝てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のレッスン後の写メで、\nおやすみさみさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/3425656/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー・みさ・らりん"}],"source":"archive"}